2026-04-27 13:20:06,358 - __main__ - INFO - Retrieved process_rule for ID J09B: ('J09B', '1. Copy the decision table into table `J09B_temp` for all records where the tour starts with `J09B`.\n\n2. Add column `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `J09B_temp`.\n\n3. Classify the meter reading type in `ENTSCHEIDUNG` using these rules:\n   - If a `HAUS` has fewer than 3 `EQUNR`, set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "KSA"`.\n   - Else set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"`.\n   - Override and set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"` for all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1 = 0`.\n   - Override and set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"` for all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `500` to `599`.\n\n4. Join `J09B_temp` with the `EABLG` table using `INSTALLATION`.\n\n5. Join the result with `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER` using `EQUNR`.\n\n6. Compare customer data from `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER`.\n\n7. If sales customer data is not empty:\n   - Use the customer table entries from `SALES_MASTER`.\n\n8. Else:\n   - Use the customer table entries from `NET_MASTER`.\n\n9. Export the final table as CSV file named `J09B` using exactly these column names:\n   - `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`\n   - `HAUS`\n   - `ANLAGE`\n   - `ME_MA_ID`\n   - `EQUNR`\n   - `HOUSE_NUM1`\n   - `ENTSCHEIDUNG`\n   - `TITLE`\n   - `FORENAME`\n   - `SURNAME`\n   - `STREET`\n   - `STREETNO`\n   - `POST_CODE1`\n   - `CITY1`\n   - `CITY2`\n   - `EMAIL`\n\n10. Send an email to `meter.readings@evu.com` with the CSV file attached.\n    - `file_path: <path_to_exported_csv_file>`\n\n11. Delete the temporary table.\n\n12. End the process.')
