2026-04-27 14:06:44,566 - __main__ - INFO - Retrieved process_rule for ID J09A: ('J09A', '1. Copy the decision table entries whose tour starts with `J09A` into table `J09A_temp`.\n\n2. Add column `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `J09A_temp`.\n\n3. Classify meter reading type in `J09A_temp` using these rules:\n   - If a `HAUS` has less than 3 `EQUNR`, set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "KSA"`.\n   - Else set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"`.\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"` for all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1 = 0`.\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"` for all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `500` to `599`.\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"` for all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `900` to `999`.\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"` for all houses in address area `Wiblingwerde` or `Breckerfeld`.\n\n4. Join `J09A_temp` with `EABLG` using `INSTALLATION`.\n\n5. Join the result with `NET_MASTER` and `SALES_MASTER` using `EQUNR`.\n\n6. Compare customer data from `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER`.\n\n7. If sales customer data is not empty:\n   1. Use the `SALES_MASTER` customer table entries.\n   Else:\n   1. Use the `NET_MASTER` customer table entries.\n\n8. Identify households with mandatory meter reading:\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "MANDATORY_READING"` for every `EQUNR` in `EABL` where both conditions are true:\n     - `ISTABLART_TXT = "Maschinelle Schätzung - SAP"` and the record was created in `2024`.\n     - `ISTABLART_TXT = "Maschinelle Schätzung - SAP"` and the record was created in `2023`.\n\n9. Export all rows with `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "MANDATORY_READING"` as CSV file `J09A_MANDATORY_READING` with columns:\n   `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n10. Send `J09A_MANDATORY_READING.csv` to the internal team:\n    - email_address: `mandatory.reading@provider.com`\n    - file_path: `<file path for J09A_MANDATORY_READING.csv here>`\n\n11. Export all remaining rows except `MANDATORY_READING` as CSV file `J09A` with columns:\n    `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n12. Send the `J09A` CSV file to EVU:\n    - Email address: `meter.readings@evu.com`\n    - file_path: `<path_to_exported_csv_file>`\n\n13. Delete the temporary table.')
