2026-04-27 14:22:50,523 - __main__ - INFO - Retrieved process_rule for ID J09C: ('J09C', '1. Copy the decision table into table `J09C_temp` for all entries where the tour starts with `J09C`.\n\n2. Add column `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `J09C_temp`.\n\n3. Classify meter reading type in `ENTSCHEIDUNG` using these rules:\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `KSA` when a `HAUS` has less than 3 `EQUNR`.\n   - Else set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1 = 0` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `500` to `599` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `900` to `999` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with address area `Wiblingwerde` or `Breckerfeld` to `EVU`.\n\n4. Join the table with `EABLG` using `INSTALLATION`.\n\n5. Join the result with `NET_MASTER` and `SALES_MASTER` using `EQUNR`.\n\n6. Compare customer data from `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER`.\n\n7. If sales customer data is not empty:\n   1. Use the sales customer data table entries.\n   Else:\n   1. Use the net customer data table entries.\n\n8. Identify households with mandatory meter reading:\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `MANDATORY_READING` for every `EQUNR` in `EABL` where both conditions are true:\n     - `ISTABLART_TXT = "Maschinelle Schätzung - SAP"` and record created in `2024`\n     - `ISTABLART_TXT = "Maschinelle Schätzung - SAP"` and record created in `2023`\n\n9. Export all rows with `ENTSCHEIDUNG = MANDATORY_READING` as CSV file `J09C_MANDATORY_READING.csv` with columns:\n   `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n10. Send `J09C_MANDATORY_READING.csv` to the internal team:\n    - email_address: `mandatory.reading@provider.com`\n    - file_path: `<file path for J09C_MANDATORY_READING.csv here>`\n\n11. Export all rows except `ENTSCHEIDUNG = MANDATORY_READING` as CSV file `J09C.csv` with columns:\n    `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n12. Send `J09C.csv` to EVU by email:\n    - email address: `meter.readings@evu.com`\n    - file_path: `<path_to_exported_csv_file>`\n\n13. Delete the temporary table.\n\n14. End the process.')
