2026-04-27 15:18:40,242 - __main__ - INFO - Retrieved process_rule for ID J09D: ('J09D', '1. Copy the decision table entries whose tour starts with `J09D` into table `J09D_temp`.\n\n2. Add column `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `J09D_temp`.\n\n3. Classify meter reading type in `J09D_temp`:\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `KSA` when a `HAUS` has less than 3 `EQUNR`; else set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1 = 0` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `500` to `599` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `900` to `999` to `EVU`.\n   - Set all houses with address area `Wiblingwerde` or `Breckerfeld` to `EVU`.\n\n4. Join `J09D_temp` with `EABLG` using `INSTALLATION`.\n\n5. Join the result with `NET_MASTER` and `SALES_MASTER` using `EQUNR`.\n\n6. Compare customer data from `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER`.\n\n7. If sales customer data is not empty:\n   - Use the `SALES_MASTER` customer table entries.\n   Else:\n   - Use the `NET_MASTER` customer table entries.\n\n8. Identify households with mandatory meter reading:\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `MANDATORY_READING` for every `EQUNR` in `EABL` where `ISTABLART_TXT = "Maschinelle Schätzung - SAP"` in a record created in `2024` and also `ISTABLART_TXT = "Maschinelle Schätzung - SAP"` in a record created in `2023`.\n\n9. Export all `MANDATORY_READING` entries as CSV file `J09D_MANDATORY_READING` with columns:\n   `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n10. Send `J09D_MANDATORY_READING.csv` to the internal team:\n   - email_address: `mandatory.reading@provider.com`\n   - file_path: `<file path for J09D_MANDATORY_READING.csv here>`\n\n11. Identify trustworthy households for meter reading self-report:\n   - Set `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to `DIRECT_MAIL` for every `EQUNR` in `EABL` where `ISTABLART_TXT = "Ablesung durch Kunden - SAP"` in `2024` and also `ISTABLART_TXT = "Ablesung durch Kunden - SAP"` in `2023`.\n\n12. Export all `DIRECT_MAIL` entries as CSV file `J09D_DIRECT_MAIL` with columns:\n   `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n13. Upload `J09D_DIRECT_MAIL.csv` to the `send_bulk_mail` service for sending direct emails to all customers.\n\n14. Export the final data excluding all `MANDATORY_READING` and `DIRECT_MAIL` entries as CSV file `J09D` with columns:\n   `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`, `HAUS`, `ANLAGE`, `ME_MA_ID`, `EQUNR`, `HOUSE_NUM1`, `ENTSCHEIDUNG`, `TITLE`, `FORENAME`, `SURNAME`, `STREET`, `STREETNO`, `POST_CODE1`, `CITY1`, `CITY2`, `EMAIL`.\n\n15. Send the `J09D.csv` file to EVU by email:\n   - Email address: `meter.readings@evu.com`\n   - file_path: `<path_to_exported_csv_file>`\n\n16. Delete the temporary table.\n\n17. End the process.')
