2026-04-27 15:54:03,197 - __main__ - INFO - Retrieved process_rule for ID J09A: ('J09A', '1. Copy the decision table into table `J09A_temp`, but only for records where the tour starts with `J09A`.\n\n2. Add column `ENTSCHEIDUNG` to table `J09A_temp`.\n\n3. Classify the meter reading type in `ENTSCHEIDUNG` using these rules:\n   - If a `HAUS` has less than 3 `EQUNR`, set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "KSA"`.\n   - Else set `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1 = 0` to `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `500` to `599` to `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"`.\n   - Set all houses with `HOUSE_NUM1` from `900` to `999` to `ENTSCHEIDUNG = "EVU"`.\n\n4. Join the current table with `EABLG` using `INSTALLATION`.\n\n5. Join the current table with `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER` using `EQUNR`.\n\n6. Compare customer data from `SALES_MASTER` and `NET_MASTER`.\n\n7. If sales customer data is not empty:\n   - Use the sales customer data table entries.\n\n8. Else:\n   - Use the net customer data table entries.\n\n9. Export the final table as CSV file named `J09A` using exactly these column names:\n   - `Meter Reading (MR) Doc. No.`\n   - `HAUS`\n   - `ANLAGE`\n   - `ME_MA_ID`\n   - `EQUNR`\n   - `HOUSE_NUM1`\n   - `ENTSCHEIDUNG`\n   - `TITLE`\n   - `FORENAME`\n   - `SURNAME`\n   - `STREET`\n   - `STREETNO`\n   - `POST_CODE1`\n   - `CITY1`\n   - `CITY2`\n   - `EMAIL`\n\n10. Send an email to `meter.readings@evu.com` with the exported CSV file attached.\n    - `file_path: <path_to_exported_csv_file>`\n\n11. Delete the temporary table.')
